{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FAST PACED RTS SUMMONER SHOOTER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767080/extras/ba279d4fa3ce3da6c0047c73faccb552.poster.avif?t=1760809996\" width=640 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767080/extras/ba279d4fa3ce3da6c0047c73faccb552.webm?t=1760809996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>Let's be honest. You're a wizard with guns. Anunnaki &amp; The Kingdom of Goku is an RTS game where you alternate between summoner and 3rd person shooter modes on the fly. The game allows you to enjoy controlling units and defending  bases at an exciting and fun pace. You are Goku, the mythical trickster monkey king, born of a stone egg, who seeks to reclaim his kingdom and throne from the vile Illuminati, who now bar your way to the stars.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical Combat Slice</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767080/extras/b8ff53877ff337372024adaaa304665b.poster.avif?t=1760809996\" width=630 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767080/extras/b8ff53877ff337372024adaaa304665b.webm?t=1760809996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is being developed by a single developer, me: FutureManFutureMartian. And this particular demo is a vertical slice into the core combat of the game. I want to know what you, the player, like, what you don't like, and what you want to see more of in the game. Above all, I aim to create a fun experience for RTS and 3rd person shooter fans. A number of non-combat features are in a development state, including some placeholder assets for these playtests. This demo and subsequent playtests are aimed specifically at showcasing gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TO THE STARS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767080/extras/bb29ae31bf46068644b3460808dcae75.poster.avif?t=1760809996\" width=630 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767080/extras/bb29ae31bf46068644b3460808dcae75.webm?t=1760809996\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Illuminati have infested both your land and the forbidden Demon Gate with demons and eldritch horrors. Brave the demonic gate, reclaim your territory, gather powerful guns, abilities, and summoning units, and defeat their demon lords. Undo the evil cabal\u2019s machinations, rekindle your kingdom\u2019s lost flame and glory, and ascend to the heavens as is your birthright.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3767080?t=1760809996","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767080/3ed3d4054c6de5cca47e550dec604933b4faefd0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760809996","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767080/eb6cdeb5a9b3f3055c9dc4b851497a7e0b0d5403/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760809996","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3767080/eb6cdeb5a9b3f3055c9dc4b851497a7e0b0d5403/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760809996","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}